<section class="roles-section" id="roles">
    <div class="intro-content">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Un sistema, varios roles</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Cada usuario ve lo que necesita</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">
            Administración, residentes, seguridad y mantenimiento trabajan sobre la misma
            plataforma, cada uno con su propia vista.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="directory-board">
        <div class="directory-board__header">Habitia · Directorio de roles</div>

        <div class="directory-board__rows">
            <div class="directory-board__row">
                <span class="directory-board__icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2"></rect>
                        <path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path>
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="directory-board__text">
                    <span class="directory-board__label">Administrador</span>
                    <span class="directory-board__desc">Cargos y pagos, documentos, asambleas y reportes administrativos.</span>
                </span>
            </div>

            <div class="directory-board__row">
                <span class="directory-board__icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="m3 11 9-8 9 8"></path>
                        <path d="M5 10v10h14V10"></path>
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="directory-board__text">
                    <span class="directory-board__label">Residente</span>
                    <span class="directory-board__desc">Pagos, reserva de amenidades, autorización de visitas y reporte de incidencias.</span>
                </span>
            </div>

            <div class="directory-board__row">
                <span class="directory-board__icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 8.7 8 11 4.6-2.3 8-6 8-11V5l-8-3z"></path>
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="directory-board__text">
                    <span class="directory-board__label">Seguridad</span>
                    <span class="directory-board__desc">Control de accesos por código QR y registro de visitantes.</span>
                </span>
            </div>

            <div class="directory-board__row">
                <span class="directory-board__icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path>
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="directory-board__text">
                    <span class="directory-board__label">Mantenimiento</span>
                    <span class="directory-board__desc">Recibe incidencias asignadas y actualiza su estado hasta resolverlas.</span>
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p class="roles-note"><strong>Un mismo usuario puede tener más de un rol</strong> dentro del condominio.</p>
</section>